OL,3,GNEWSA'Our mum needed help' says
OL,4,Adaughter of woman whose death was ruled
OL,5,Apreventable
OL,6,
OL,7,FA woman's death at the Royal Victoria
OL,8,FHospital (RVH) in 2019 has been ruled
OL,9,Fpreventable by a coroner in Belfast.
OL,11,FLillian Diamond was 60 when she
OL,12,Funderwent an elective splenectomy
OL,13,Fsurgery at the Mater Hospital. She died
OL,14,Fweeks later.
OL,16,FCoroner Anne-Louise Toal told her
OL,17,Ffamily at Laganside Court in Belfast
OL,18,Fthat Diamond's death was "on balance of
OL,19,Fprobabilities preventable" but she
OL,20,Fnoted that there has been "significant
OL,21,Flearning" and "cultural change" since
OL,22,F2019.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
